2bb3be06-c076-4e1d-bdf2-797cb8949e91	CSERP-023	Verify CSRF cookie spiral — 7 consecutive fix attempts may have broken auth flow	critical	auth	false_positive	Between commits de04613 and e388ae1 (Mar 20-21), 7 consecutive CSRF cookie fixes were attempted. The final approach inlines getCsrfToken. Need to verify: (a) CSRF cookies are set correctly on login, (b) all mutations can read the cookie, (c) register flow works end-to-end.	DEEP INVESTIGATION RESULT: The CSRF flow works correctly end-to-end.\n\nVERIFIED PATH:\n1. Login/Register → sets cs_csrf cookie (httpOnly=false, secure=true, sameSite=strict, path=/, 30d)\n2. Client reads cookie via document.cookie.split() in getCsrfToken()\n3. Mutations send x-csrf-token header with cookie value\n4. Server validates: cookie value === header value (constant-time comparison)\n\nTESTED:\n- Register via HTTPS → 201, all 3 cookies set correctly\n- Immediate PATCH with CSRF → 200 success\n- PATCH without CSRF → 403 (correct rejection)\n- GET without CSRF → 200 (correctly skipped)\n\nFILES VERIFIED:\n- src/lib/csrf.ts: validateCsrfToken() reads cs_csrf cookie + x-csrf-token header ✓\n- src/lib/cookies.ts: setCsrfCookie() sets httpOnly=false ✓\n- src/lib/client/csrf.ts: getCsrfToken() reads cs_csrf from document.cookie ✓\n- src/app/api/auth/login/route.ts line 269: calls setCsrfCookie ✓\n- src/app/api/auth/register/route.ts line 170: calls setCsrfCookie ✓\n- 55 form components: all import getCsrfToken from @/lib/client/csrf ✓\n- 2 inline getCsrfToken (processes/instances, e2e-flows/definition): read correct cookie cs_csrf ✓\n- DeleteButton component: uses getCsrfToken from @/lib/client/csrf ✓\n\nTHE 7 COMMIT SPIRAL (de04613→e388ae1) was messy but the final state is correct. The inline getCsrfToken approach in 2 files is unnecessary technical debt but functionally equivalent.\n\nSTATUS: CSRF is NOT broken. This is a FALSE POSITIVE.	fix-and-break-spiral	\N	\N	\N	\N	No fix needed. CSRF flow is functional. The 7-commit spiral resulted in a working final state. Two files use inline getCsrfToken (tech debt) but functionally correct.	\N	\N	2026-03-23 12:47:15.396956+00	\N	\N	["src/lib/csrf.ts", "src/lib/cookies.ts", "src/lib/client/csrf.ts", "src/app/api/auth/login/route.ts"]	[]	cs-erp-audit-2026-03-23	29	2026-03-23 12:02:36.381011+00	2026-03-23 12:47:15.396956+00	\N	\N
