rrent lead record to review before scoring\\",\\"input_schema\\":{\\"type\\":\\"object\\",\\"properties\\":{\\"leadId\\":{\\"type\\":\\"string\\",\\"description\\":\\"UUID of the lead\\"}},\\"required\\":[\\"leadId\\"]}}]}"	\N	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	system	\N	1	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-04-01 12:32:37.521486+00	2026-04-01 12:32:37.521486+00
