2a8b0067-cc14-479b-86cf-9f78391a658e	\N	E2E-07-S06	Collections gate: review and decide action	Collections manager reviews customers that have not responded to level 2 dunning and decides next action. Options: continue dunning (give more time — e.g., customer communicated delay reason), activate booking hold (suspend new bookings until payment received), suspend credit limit (reduce to zero — no new exposure), escalate to enforcement (level 3 legal notice), or negotiate payment plan (for customers in genuine financial difficulty). Consider: customer value (top-20 customer may get more leeway), payment history (first-time offender vs habitual), amount at risk, and commercial relationship impact. Document decision for audit trail.	\N	human	gate	\N	\N	"{\\"mode\\":\\"gate\\"}"	decision	Collections Manager / Credit Controller	8.00	t	\N	\N	system	\N	1	t	"[{\\"field\\":\\"Level 2 Dunning Results\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 5 output\\",\\"required\\":true,\\"providedBy\\":\\"step:5\\"},{\\"field\\":\\"Customer Communication History\\",\\"source\\":\\"CRM\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Customer Value (revenue ranking)\\",\\"source\\":\\"CRM\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Credit Utilization\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 2 output\\",\\"required\\":true,\\"providedBy\\":\\"step:2\\"}]"	"[\\"Action Decision per Customer\\",\\"Booking Hold Activated (Y/N)\\",\\"Credit Suspension Triggered (Y/N)\\",\\"Payment Plan Offered (Y/N)\\",\\"Escalation to Level 3 (Y/N)\\"]"	"[\\"All overdue customers reviewed\\",\\"Decision considers commercial impact\\",\\"Actions proportionate to risk\\",\\"Decision documented\\"]"	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-04-01 12:32:40.013399+00	2026-04-01 12:32:40.013399+00
9ad9f14a-754c-48ff-92cd-252945655fc7	\N	E2E-07-S08	Booking hold notification	Notify all relevant parties about booking hold status. Internal notifications: booking team (cannot confirm new bookings), sales/commercial team (account is on hold — stop soliciting new business until resolved), operations team (existing shipments may be affected), and customer service (incoming queries about booking rejections). External notification: formal letter to customer stating booking hold, reason (overdue payment), required action (payment to reinstate), and escalation path (who to contact to resolve). For customers with active shipments: do NOT hold cargo already at terminal or on vessel — complete in-progress shipments but hold new acceptance.	\N	ai_agent	\N	\N	\N	"{\\"mode\\":\\"ai_with_tools\\",\\"systemPromptExtra\\":\\"You are a Notification Agent for a container shipping line.\\\\nGenerate booking hold notifications for customers with suspended credit:\\\\n1. Draft notification to customer explaining booking hold status\\\\n2. Notify internal teams: booking desk, sales rep, account manager\\\\n3. Set booking system flag to block new bookings\\\\n4. Specify conditions for hold release\\\\n\\\\nProvide your analysis as structured JSON with: customerName, holdReason, customerNotification, internalNotifications, holdConditions, estimatedResolutionDate.\\"}"	\N	Notification AI Agent	1.00	t	\N	\N	system	\N	1	t	"[{\\"field\\":\\"Booking Hold Status\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 7 output\\",\\"required\\":true,\\"providedBy\\":\\"step:7\\"},{\\"field\\":\\"Customer Details\\",\\"source\\":\\"Customer Master\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Active Shipments (in progress)\\",\\"source\\":\\"Operations\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Internal Contact List (sales, ops, CS)\\",\\"source\\":\\"CRM\\",\\"required\\":true}]"	"[\\"Internal Notifications Sent\\",\\"Customer Hold Letter Sent\\",\\"Active Shipments Protected\\",\\"Hold Status Published in System\\"]"	"[\\"All internal teams notified\\",\\"Customer letter sent to correct contact\\",\\"Active shipments not disrupted\\",\\"Hold visible in booking system\\"]"	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-04-01 12:32:40.018066+00	2026-04-01 12:32:40.018066+00
