9ecda190-a384-4ae1-a38b-edf9045cca9e	\N	E2E-28-S04	Sanctions gate: investigate match (false positive?)	Compliance officer investigates each actionable match to determine if it is a true match or false positive. Investigation steps: (1) Compare full entity details — name spelling variants, date of birth, place of birth, nationality, passport/ID numbers, address, business activity; (2) Check publicly available information — company registries, media reports, court records; (3) Request additional documentation from the entity — passport copy, beneficial ownership declaration, source of funds; (4) Vessel-specific checks — if vessel match, check AIS history (did vessel visit sanctioned ports?), ownership chain, flag state history; (5) Consult sanctions guidance — OFAC FAQ, EU guidance notes, industry best practices (sanctions compliance guidance from shipping associations like BIMCO, ICS). Decisions: (a) FALSE POSITIVE — documented evidence proves it is not the sanctioned entity, clear and log; (b) TRUE MATCH — entity matches sanctioned party, escalate for immediate action; (c) INCONCLUSIVE — insufficient evidence to determine, apply precautionary freeze and request more information. For true matches: immediately freeze all transactions, halt any pending bookings/payments, and escalate to senior management and legal.	\N	human	gate	\N	\N	"{\\"mode\\":\\"gate\\"}"	decision	Compliance Officer / MLRO	24.00	t	\N	\N	system	\N	1	t	"[{\\"field\\":\\"Prioritized Match Investigation Queue\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 3 Output\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Sanctions List Entry Details\\",\\"source\\":\\"Sanctions List Provider\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Entity KYC Documentation\\",\\"source\\":\\"CRM / Vendor Module\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"AIS Vessel Tracking History (if vessel match)\\",\\"source\\":\\"AIS Provider\\",\\"required\\":false},{\\"field\\":\\"Public Information Sources (company registries, media)\\",\\"source\\":\\"External Research\\",\\"required\\":false}]"	"[\\"Investigation Decision (False Positive / True Match / Inconclusive)\\",\\"Investigation Report with Evidence\\",\\"Transaction Freeze Order (if true match)\\",\\"Cleared Entity Record (if false positive)\\",\\"Escalation Notification (if true match)\\",\\"Additional Information Request (if inconclusive)\\"]"	"[\\"Investigation documented with evidence supporting the decision\\",\\"True matches escalated immediately to senior management\\",\\"All transactions frozen for true/inconclusive matches\\",\\"False positive clearance includes specific distinguishing evidence\\"]"	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-04-01 12:32:40.735071+00	2026-04-01 12:32:40.735071+00
40d10ffe-e08f-4365-af2f-b442b2d47e06	\N	E2E-28-S08	License gate: verify valid license before shipment	Compliance manager verifies that all required export licenses are in order before authorizing shipment of controlled goods. This is a hard gate — no cargo subject to export control may be loaded without documented license compliance. Review: (1) License copy on file — verify it is genuine (check with issuing authority if in doubt); (2) License conditions met — destination, end-user, quantity, value all within license terms; (3) Red flags assessment — any indicators of diversion (unusual routing, inconsistent end-user, transshipment through free trade zones); (4) Shipper's declaration — signed declaration from shipper confirming they hold a valid export license and the cargo is being shipped in compliance with all export control regulations; (5) Carrier's obligation — while the carrier is typically not the exporter, carrying goods in knowing violation of export controls can result in secondary sanctions and loss of trading privileges. For shipments without valid licenses: reject the booking, notify the shipper, and report to compliance records.	\N	human	gate	\N	\N	"{\\"mode\\":\\"gate\\"}"	approval	Compliance Manager	8.00	t	\N	\N	system	\N	1	t	"[{\\"field\\":\\"License Validation Results\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 7 Output\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Export License Copy\\",\\"source\\":\\"Customer / Documentation\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Shipper's Export Compliance Declaration\\",\\"source\\":\\"Customer\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Red Flag Indicators (if any)\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 7 Output\\",\\"required\\":false}]"	"[\\"Shipment Authorization (Approved/Rejected)\\",\\"License Compliance Confirmation\\",\\"Red Flag Resolution (if applicable)\\",\\"Rejection Notice (if rejected)\\",\\"Compliance File for Audit Trail\\"]"	"[\\"Valid export license confirmed on file\\",\\"All license conditions met for this specific shipment\\",\\"