91dc58f8-07b9-4411-919b-2ba8aa87eacc	\N	E2E-38-S09	Physical crew change at port	Execute the physical crew change at the designated port. The port agent coordinates: (1) Immigration clearance — present joining crew to immigration with seaman's books, visas, and vessel letter; (2) Customs clearance — crew personal effects may need customs inspection; (3) Transport to vessel — arrange launch boat if vessel is at anchorage, or vehicle if at berth; (4) Sign-on ceremony — joining crew signs the Articles of Agreement (crew agreement) before an authorized officer (master or shipping master); (5) Sign-off ceremony — departing crew signs off the Articles; (6) Personal effects transfer — manage baggage for both joining and departing crew; (7) Port health clearance — if required by port state; (8) Safety equipment allocation — assign cabin, safety muster station, lifeboat number to joining crew. Timing is critical — crew change must be completed before vessel's scheduled departure. If vessel is on tight schedule, partial overlap of joining/departing crew may be needed.	\N	human	gate	\N	\N	"{\\"mode\\":\\"ai_with_tools\\",\\"systemPromptExtra\\":\\"You are a Crew Change Execution Agent. Coordinate physical crew change at port — launch service, immigration, customs. Provide JSON with: joiningCrew, departingCrew, changePort, launchBooked, immigration.\\"}"	input	Port Agent / Vessel Master	12.00	t	\N	\N	system	\N	1	t	"[{\\"field\\":\\"Joining Crew with Travel Itineraries\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 6 Output\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Departing Crew List\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 1 Output\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Vessel Berthing/Anchorage Details\\",\\"source\\":\\"Operations Module\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Port Agent Contact and Arrangements\\",\\"source\\":\\"Port Agency Module\\",\\"required\\":true},{\\"field\\":\\"Immigration Pre-Clearance\\",\\"source\\":\\"Step 5 Output\\",\\"required\\":true}]"	"[\\"Sign-On Record (joining crew)\\",\\"Sig